 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505715,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Determine if  <span data-math=\"\\frac{8}{{14}}\">\\frac{8}{{14}}</span> and  <span data-math=\"\\frac{{12}}{{26}}\">\\frac{{12}}{{26}}</span> are equivalent fractions.",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Two fractions, <span data-math=\"\\frac{a}{b}\"></span> and <span data-math=\"\\frac{c}{d}\"></span> are equivalent if <span data-math=\"a \\times d = b \\times c\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"a \\times d = 8 \\times 26 = 208\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"b \\times c = 14 \\times 12 = 168\"></span></p>\n<p>Because the products are not the same, the fractions are not equivalent.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"a \\times b = 8 \\times 26 = 208\">a \\times b = 8 \\times 26 = 208</span> and <span data-math=\"b \\times c = 14 \\times 12 = 168\">b \\times c = 14 \\times 12 = 168</span>. The fractions are not equivalent."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
